      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso (ninth section of join): T-S AS 189v + T-S AS 120.190r",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>and br[ough]t him before R. Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah.</li>\n<li>And they raised him up and they hung him on the stem</li>\n<li>of the cabbage (?), which is sprouting (?).&nbsp;But before</li>\n<li>they raised him to the cross [he k]new what</li>\n<li>is written in the Torah, &ldquo;Do not let his corp[se remain overni]ght</li>\n<li>on the tree.&rdquo; And at that mom[ent] he sent</li>\n<li>and called the people whom he had misled, and said</li>\n<li>to them: &ldquo;If you come tomorrow you will not find me,</li>\n<li>nor my body, on the cross&mdash;you will surely know</li>\n<li>that I ascended to the firmament of Heaven,</li>\n<li>and you will not see me.&rdquo;&nbsp;They crucified him alive,</li>\n<li>and stoned him with stones, and he died</li>\n<li>[on] the tree. And [they did not want] to take him down</li>\n<li>from the tree.&nbsp; [They said] to R. Yehoshu\u02bfa</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
